nts” means any and all arrangements entered into by any Exar Originator and any Claims Administration Bank whereby short-term loans (which loans shall be secured solely by Claim Administration Liens) are made by such Claims Administration Bank to any Exar Originator; provided, that the proceeds of such loans are deposited in one or more segregated deposit or securities accounts and are solely used to purchase Claims Administration Investments (which shall be held in such segregated accounts) and pay transaction costs in connection therewith.","context":"(3)except as expressly permitted pursuant to Section 5.6, the Borrower shall cease to, directly or indirectly own and control one hundred percent (100%) of each class of the outstanding equity interests of any Subsidiary the assets of which contribute more than $5,000,000 to the Borrowing Base.","section":"","block":455,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-037421","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1839530/000110465926037421/xbp-20251231xex10d22.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/de2f790ea40081ea59934629537d0b13124bcf4450489da18803ba84dfd1c0de.bin","sha256":"de2f790ea40081ea59934629537d0b13124bcf4450489da18803ba84dfd1c0de"}},{"id":"1d9f5e696290596df68944de5956e78be789f4e44cc3747c29b910767ef30c64","quote":"“Collateral” means, subject to the ABL Intercreditor Agreement, all property, now existing or hereafter acquired, mortgaged or pledged to, or purported to be subjected to a Lien in favor of, Agent, for the benefit of Agent and Lenders, pursuant to this Agreement and the Security Documents, including, without limitation, all of the property described in Schedule 9.1 hereto.","context":"“Code” means the Internal Revenue Code of 1986, as amended from time to time, any successor statutes thereto, and applicable U.S. Department of Tr